WEBVTT

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:07.540
Is Jung Ji-eun's notable works
her Instagram?

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.420
Think it through.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.280
That's all for today's live stream.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.690
The company has decided to give you

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:29.150
a final 2 weeks for observation.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Up till midnight on June 6.

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:35.830
The target KPI is

00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:38.570
sales of 10 billion KRW.

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:42.870
A mini album.

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.930
We will produce and release one
in 2 weeks.

00:00:48.810 --> 00:00:49.380
Ji-eun.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:54.510
Can I kiss you?

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.750
[Broadcast channel
live stream interview]

00:01:38.280 --> 00:01:38.950
Ji-eun.

00:01:39.350 --> 00:01:41.850
This is your first time joining us
for an exclusive

00:01:41.850 --> 00:01:42.920
group interview, right?

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:43.330
Yes.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:46.850
Yes. Please look after me.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:50.509
Don't be too nervous.

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.800
Just take it as a chat between friends.

00:01:53.060 --> 00:01:53.860
Are you ready?

00:01:54.900 --> 00:01:55.930
Yes.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:05.080
Okay. Three, two, one. Action.

00:02:06.400 --> 00:02:09.639
Hello. I am today's host, Song Minah.

00:02:10.280 --> 00:02:12.880
Today, we've invited
Wonder-X's third member,

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:15.000
Jung Ji-eun.

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:17.610
I heard you've been preparing a new song.

00:02:17.800 --> 00:02:18.500
Yes.

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.450
We're preparing a mini album.

00:02:21.790 --> 00:02:24.710
All of our members are doing their best.

00:02:30.079 --> 00:02:30.470
Yes.

00:02:30.610 --> 00:02:33.470
We are working very hard
on preparing this mini album.

00:02:33.470 --> 00:02:33.890
[When are we going to see the disbandment news article?
I think Jung Ji-eun would be better off going solo.
Can this girl group even keep going?
Are the fans doing okay? The members look so awkward with each other.
What is up with Jung Ji-eun's expression?
How much longer can Wonder-X last? When are we finally going to see the disbandment news?
Looking at Jung Ji-eun's face, her heart clearly isn't in it anymore.
This isn't going to be their last livestream, is it?
What is the agency's stance on this? It looks like Wonder-X is finished.]

00:02:33.890 --> 00:02:35.690
Please look forward to it.

00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:36.720
Thank you.

00:02:41.829 --> 00:02:44.650
Okay. Practice must be tough.

00:02:44.990 --> 00:02:48.450
You must be stressed as a new member too.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:50.980
It's stressful,

00:02:51.520 --> 00:02:54.750
but with Yebin and Minah's help,

00:02:55.090 --> 00:02:56.920
I've been pushing through.

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:00.850
Recently,

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:04.670
there has been talk about
Wonder-X's disbandment on the internet.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.910
Wonder-X will not disband.

00:03:08.790 --> 00:03:10.920
You look very sure.

00:03:11.760 --> 00:03:12.360
Yes.

00:03:13.570 --> 00:03:15.530
We cherish each other

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:17.710
a lot.

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:22.960
Yebin is always protecting us quietly.

00:03:23.420 --> 00:03:24.930
Minah also

00:03:25.579 --> 00:03:28.470
works very hard.

00:03:29.190 --> 00:03:32.420
I'm also very happy

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:35.360
to be able to join Wonder-X.

00:03:36.570 --> 00:03:39.460
No matter what happens,

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:41.520
we will never be apart.

00:03:43.390 --> 00:03:44.350
Yes.

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:47.260
Let's move on to the next segment.

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:48.920
It's the Q&A session.

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.280
Ji-eun, pick one.

00:04:08.660 --> 00:04:10.500
The first note.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:22.350
Is Jung Ji-eun's notable works
her Instagram?

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:39.920
O-Our group has many other notable works.

00:04:41.080 --> 00:04:43.409
Please look forward to more in the future.

00:04:45.600 --> 00:04:47.330
Next question.

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:02.300
One of the biggest controversies
surrounding Jung Ji-eun

00:05:02.950 --> 00:05:06.020
is how she parachuted into the group.

00:05:07.080 --> 00:05:08.330
There are many people

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.160
who are questioning

00:05:11.260 --> 00:05:12.520
why she got the chance.

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:17.380
We would like to hear what Jung Ji-eun
has to say about this.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:35.140
[Is Kang Yebin in love with Jung Ji-eun? She definitely likes her, haha.
Whoa, did you see that just now? What was with that look Kang Yebin gave her?
Wait, no way, right? Kang Yebin's aura is insane.]

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:38.220
Since starting my career as an idol,
I've foreseen

00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:40.830
that I'd be asked questions like this.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.130
We're just ordinary girls.

00:05:44.250 --> 00:05:46.470
But we keep living in bad comments.

00:05:47.720 --> 00:05:49.750
Those who are watching this,

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.409
think about

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.470
how rude this question was.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:57.180
That's all for today's live stream.

00:06:14.740 --> 00:06:16.370
[This is like watching a movie. Kang Yebin's expression is so serious.
The look in Kang Yebin's eyes has totally changed. Whoa, what is the deal between those two?
There is definitely something going on between them. Yebin-unnie is insanely cool!]

00:06:16.370 --> 00:06:17.640
Thank you.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:52.520
Are you okay?

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:54.000
Yeah.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:01.620
Bin.

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.340
Thank you so much for today.

00:07:06.380 --> 00:07:07.250
Don't say that.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:10.170
I just did what I should do as a leader.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.110
But

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:15.930
you did a good job today.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:17.420
You were very calm.

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.520
But

00:07:23.600 --> 00:07:27.360
will the fans
be disappointed to hear that?

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.500
I care about your feelings

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:32.530
more than the fans'.

00:07:38.360 --> 00:07:40.020
More importantly,

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:42.280
I just want you to be happy.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:47.140
It's great

00:07:47.890 --> 00:07:48.980
with you here.

00:07:53.710 --> 00:07:54.420
Let's go.

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.370
We have to go to the company.

00:08:13.740 --> 00:08:14.800
Hello.

00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:20.430
Get in the car first.

00:08:21.060 --> 00:08:21.970
Thank you.

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:39.100
Your shoulders are wet.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.659
Let me put a blanket on you.

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.770
The heater is on.

00:08:52.610 --> 00:08:53.380
Bin.

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:54.060
Mm?

00:08:55.800 --> 00:08:57.400
Thank you for today.

00:08:59.270 --> 00:09:02.530
If it weren't for you,
something bad would've happened.

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:07.580
The person who wrote that question
was the one in the wrong.

00:09:09.670 --> 00:09:11.520
You were really cool today.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:13.990
I almost fell for you.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:16.830
I'm also

00:09:17.170 --> 00:09:19.940
really happy to be on a show with you.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:29.000
Your hands are cold.

00:09:34.750 --> 00:09:35.950
Is it better now?

00:09:37.740 --> 00:09:38.160
Yes.

00:09:39.050 --> 00:09:39.770
It's nice.

00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:51.160
Ji-eun.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:58.340
Can I kiss you?

00:10:38.470 --> 00:10:39.650
Ji-eun.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.080
I've always wanted to say this.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:47.780
You've worked hard

00:10:49.190 --> 00:10:51.120
through this journey.

00:11:54.990 --> 00:11:57.120
This is the company's final decision.

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.130
It was a difficult decision.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:04.330
Thank you for your hard work
for this period of time.

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:10.760
The company has decided to give you

00:12:11.300 --> 00:12:13.440
a final 2 weeks for observation.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.170
Up till midnight on June 6.

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:19.850
The target KPI is

00:12:20.540 --> 00:12:23.050
sales of 10 billion KRW.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:28.070
If you don't hit

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:30.990
the target sales within this time frame,

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:34.850
we'll follow our original plan
and disband Wonder-X.

00:12:37.280 --> 00:12:38.660
10 billion KRW?

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:43.330
We've just exceeded 5 billion KRW

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:46.610
with all our sales
accumulated since our debut.

00:12:50.590 --> 00:12:51.350
This is

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.040
really the final chance.

00:12:57.880 --> 00:12:59.710
I believe you can do it.

00:13:05.600 --> 00:13:06.600
We can do it.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:11.950
This was a difficult decision.

00:13:12.530 --> 00:13:14.880
Let me make this clear:

00:13:16.230 --> 00:13:17.880
popularity and buzz—

00:13:18.010 --> 00:13:20.010
they are both double-edged swords.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:21.530
Don't think you can get applause

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:23.560
just by working hard.

00:13:23.840 --> 00:13:25.250
What follows might be

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:27.170
more sharp criticism and condemnation—

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:29.170
and even malicious attacks.

00:13:30.590 --> 00:13:32.280
Yebin and Minah are experienced,

00:13:32.280 --> 00:13:33.880
so they can get through it.

00:13:34.920 --> 00:13:37.250
But this target is different from before.

00:13:38.850 --> 00:13:39.980
Ji-eun especially—

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.440
you need to be mentally prepared.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:44.120
Determination is not enough.

00:13:44.280 --> 00:13:45.890
You need a strong heart.

00:13:53.830 --> 00:13:54.630
All right.

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:56.340
I'll stop here.

00:13:58.740 --> 00:14:01.240
Come on, tell me:

00:14:01.980 --> 00:14:02.960
how are you going

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:04.820
to hit 10 billion KRW?

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:08.740
A mini album.

00:14:09.470 --> 00:14:11.800
We will produce and release one
in 2 weeks.

00:14:12.820 --> 00:14:13.560
Two weeks?

00:14:15.470 --> 00:14:17.070
How is that possible?

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:21.570
How can you say that's impossible

00:14:21.610 --> 00:14:23.210
before even trying?

00:14:25.570 --> 00:14:28.030
Ji-eun can compose,
I will write the lyrics,

00:14:28.590 --> 00:14:30.120
and Minah can be the visual.

00:14:36.360 --> 00:14:38.020
We can reach 10 billion KRW...

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.490
in 2 weeks.

00:15:17.840 --> 00:15:21.900
[Evaluation Report]
[Rookie girl group Wonder-X's debut preparation and evaluation]

00:15:45.200 --> 00:15:46.290
This won't work.

00:15:48.280 --> 00:15:50.340
This melody is too ordinary.

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:53.840
Shall we take a break?

00:15:55.920 --> 00:15:56.640
Bin.

00:15:57.390 --> 00:15:59.120
We don't have time to rest.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.230
Shall I play for you?

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:14.550
Huh?

00:16:52.250 --> 00:16:53.020
This is...

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:04.640
The song you wrote for me
in our high school freshman year—

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:06.310
do you remember?

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.319
The title...

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:11.210
Was it "Scandal Love"?

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:16.290
I was serious

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:18.470
back then, though.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:26.310
I remember now.

00:17:36.070 --> 00:17:37.500
I'm exhausted.

00:17:40.270 --> 00:17:42.300
The school club is too tiring.

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.890
Should I just quit?

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.150
Why did you bring your guitar?

00:18:03.860 --> 00:18:04.490
Bin.

00:18:04.800 --> 00:18:05.280
Yeah?

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:08.510
I wrote a song.

00:18:10.660 --> 00:18:11.330
Really?

00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:12.120
You?

00:18:12.920 --> 00:18:14.340
Can you play it for me?

00:18:14.630 --> 00:18:15.490
Quick!

00:18:18.300 --> 00:18:20.480
The song is called

00:18:20.960 --> 00:18:21.930
"Scandal Love."

00:18:23.440 --> 00:18:25.250
It's not that it's a great song.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:27.610
Don't laugh after hearing it.

00:18:27.770 --> 00:18:29.310
Why would I laugh at you?

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:30.620
Play it for me, quick!

00:19:38.260 --> 00:19:38.990
Ji-eun.

00:19:40.730 --> 00:19:42.360
Is the "Love" in this song

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:44.730
me?

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:48.860
Yeah.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:51.700
Ji-eun, listen carefully.

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.830
You’re my future composer—

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:55.850
my exclusive producer.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.670
We will reach the top.

00:20:00.370 --> 00:20:02.030
So we won't give up.

00:20:02.810 --> 00:20:03.540
Understand?

00:21:13.170 --> 00:21:14.600
I think the chorus

00:21:14.930 --> 00:21:16.590
can be repeated another time.

00:21:20.160 --> 00:21:20.730
Okay.

00:21:21.330 --> 00:21:23.960
Let me think about the lyrics.

00:22:32.550 --> 00:22:33.400
Use this.

00:22:34.930 --> 00:22:37.030
Are you fighting a pencil?

00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:40.710
Thank you,

00:22:40.710 --> 00:22:41.170
Jin.

00:22:42.380 --> 00:22:45.840
Normally, I'd fight my pencil
if I can't solve some equations.

00:22:48.940 --> 00:22:49.740
That's right.

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:52.100
I've seen that.

00:22:57.020 --> 00:22:57.950
Does that mean

00:22:58.860 --> 00:23:01.160
you've been watching me do my homework?

00:23:03.520 --> 00:23:03.990
Yes.

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:08.430
You look like the heroine of a comic book

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:11.340
when you're studying hard.

00:23:13.740 --> 00:23:14.870
What are you talking about?

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:16.270
What comic protagonist?

00:23:17.520 --> 00:23:18.820
Are you pulling my leg?

00:23:25.120 --> 00:23:25.640
Yes.

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:29.230
Let the pencil off
next time you get it wrong.

00:23:33.690 --> 00:23:34.750
So

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:37.120
you always look at me when I study?

00:23:41.030 --> 00:23:41.700
Yes.

00:23:42.840 --> 00:23:44.830
You look like the heroine of a comic book

00:23:44.830 --> 00:23:46.920
when you're studying hard.

00:23:49.890 --> 00:23:51.430
What are you talking about?

00:23:52.330 --> 00:23:53.590
Are you pulling my leg?

00:23:57.460 --> 00:23:58.230
But

00:23:58.930 --> 00:24:01.730
the comic protagonist
needs some encouragement.

00:24:02.490 --> 00:24:03.420
Ms. Ji-eun,

00:24:04.160 --> 00:24:06.560
can you teach me
how to solve this question?

00:24:10.350 --> 00:24:10.980
Sure.

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:15.060
I'll teach you once.

00:24:35.930 --> 00:24:37.030
Teach me.

00:24:39.150 --> 00:24:39.950
Quick!

00:25:21.550 --> 00:25:22.450
Wonder-X...

00:25:24.150 --> 00:25:25.160
Wonder-X...